.  aDigital collection: Federal Depository Library Program Web Archive.  aA site designed to educate citizens about the dangers of driving while distracted. Includes key facts and statistics about risk factors and distraction-affected fatalities and accidents. Provides a summary of each state's (or territory's) laws pertaining to the use of cell phones and handheld devices while driving. Provides checklists, toolkits, and supporting documents for parents, educators, employers and community groups to educate teens and others about safe driving practices.  aDescription based on: archived web page captured Jul 12, 2012; title from title screen (viewed Feb. 4, 2013). 0aDistracted drivingzUnited States. 0aTraffic safetyzUnited States. 0aCell phones and traffic accidentszUnited States. 0aCell phones and teenagerszUnited States. 7aCell phones and teenagers.2fast0(OCoLC)fst01749451 7aCell phones and traffic accidents.2fast0(OCoLC)fst01745627 7aDistracted driving.2fast0(OCoLC)fst00895568 7aTraffic safety.2fast0(OCoLC)fst01154212 7aUnited States.2fast0(OCoLC)fst012041552 aFederal Depository Library Program,0https://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n86862627ecollector.1 aUnited States.bGovernment Printing Office,0https://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n79143109edistributor.1 aUnited States.bGovernment Publishing Office,0https://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no2015002503edistributor.0 tFederal Depository Library Program Web Archivew(OCoLC)88385693240zHome page by archived datesuhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo277884 zURL at time of captureuhttp://www.distraction.gov/  3(online)uhttps://catalog.gpo.gov/fdlpdir/locate.jsp?ItemNumber=0982-D-51&SYS=000919309  aC0bGPO  aGPOO  abca12 20170124  abca88 20140219  aWEBARCH 20140204  abca88 20140204b2018060402526cai a2200553Ii 000919349OCoLC20180604134504.0m     o  d f      cr |||||||||||140205c20uu9999dcu x w o    f0    2eng d  a(OCoLC)869885479  aGPObenger